{start_of_verse: label="Verse 1" bars="16"}
[D]Sun comes up on the [G]old dirt road
[Bm]Coffee's warm and the [A]wind is slow
[D]Every mile is a [G]song I know
[Em]Carry me [A]home
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
[G]Oh, the [D]morning road
[A]Takes me [Bm]where I go
[G]Light is [D]soft and [A]low
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: label="Verse 2" bars="16"}
[D]Fields of gold where the [G]rivers bend
[Bm]Every stranger [A]feels like a friend
[D]Every ending's a [G]start again
[Em]Carry me [A]home
{end_of_verse}

{chorus}

